{"verdict":"approved","issues":[{"severity":"minor","file":"src/services/submit-reservations/apply-report-discounts.service.ts","line":121,"description":"The file is missing a trailing newline at end of file (the diff shows '\\ No newline at end of file'). Most linters and editors expect a final newline.","suggestedFix":"Add a single trailing newline at the end of the file."}],"summary":"The implementation is the exact prescribed minimal fix: one import addition and one line change in apply-report-discounts.service.ts. The change replaces the direct equality check `lineItem.id === discount.lineItemId` with `parseDispatchLineItemKey(lineItem.id).id === discount.lineItemId`, correctly extracting the raw order line item ID from the composite dispatch key (which encodes id + '#return' for return trips) before comparing. This reuses the existing `parseDispatchLineItemKey` helper from `src/services/helpers/order/dispatch-line-item-key.ts` — no hand-rolled logic. No other files were modified, matching the prescribed root cause fix. TypeScript strict compilation passes (tsc --noEmit exits 0). The accompanying vitest spec (5 tests, all passing) covers every acceptance criterion: (1) return trip discount applied with correct amount, (2) discount labeled with promo code name ('Code:PROMO10'), (3) outbound dispatch still works, (4) multi-dispatch return trip with remaining discount correctly split, (5) no promo code → no discount displayed. No security concerns (no API keys, no path traversal, no HTTP routes involved). The only issue is a missing trailing newline at end of file, which is cosmetic."}
